{
  "description": "Mobile emulation, DPR 3, touch, R-23: live resizing of the loaded page, with no reload and no input. From 09's 390x844 portrait it emulates in turn 480x844, 600x960, 768x1024, 820x1180 and 1024x1366 portrait (angle 0), then 1024x768, 1180x820, 1280x800 and 844x390 landscape (angle 90), then 390x844 portrait again, each with DPR 3, touch, the mobile flag and a screen of the same size; emulate sends no user agent, so 09's stays. After each change it waits 1 s, reads the metrics and asserts the viewport, screen, orientation, DPR, touch and canvas backing store (a mismatch stops it), then reads the layout (the document language and direction and the boxes of the Rectangle, Library, Undo, More tools, Selection and Hand buttons) and saves ARIA and a capture, and asserts the portrait metrics once more at the end. Runs right after 09 in a fresh session.",
